  "title": "Zucchini with Dill Weed and Garlic-Yogurt Sauce",
  "description": "This zucchini with dill weed and garlic-yogurt sauce recipe, which includes rice, is a refreshing and tasty Mediterranean-style dish. Serve with bread.",
